<![CDATA[<div align="center" style=""><div align="center" style="text-align: center;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">There's never been a better time to use your business's Qantas Points</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2033550866/Qantas_Business_Rewards_eDM_Banner2_680x70.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2037683537/QBR_CFR_680x400.gif" title="See where your points can take you" alt="See where your points can take you" style="width: 680px; display: block;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 26px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Get back 5,000 Qantas Points when you redeem a flight</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[Name]</span>,</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thanks for the chat earlier. As discussed, it's now easier and more rewarding than ever to use your business's Qantas&nbsp;Points to book a flight.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Instead of transferring points, you can simply book a Classic Flight Reward<span style="vertical-align: 1px; font-size: 13px; bottom: 0.3ex; position: relative;">~</span>&nbsp;or Points Plus Pay flight^^&nbsp;<strong>directly from your Business Rewards account</strong>.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Try it out now, and until the 22&nbsp;November 2021,&nbsp;<strong>get back 5,000 Qantas Points</strong>* in your Qantas Business Rewards account to help you on your way to your next trip.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Simply log in to your Qantas Business Rewards account and search all flight options. You can use your points to redeem available Classic Flight Reward seats on Qantas or Jetstar or use Points Plus Pay - Flights across Qantas, Jetstar, and selected partner airlines.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; text-align: center; width: 600px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">How to take up this offer</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" width="180px" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; width: 180px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="180px" height="150px"><tbody><tr width="180px" valign="top;"><td align="center" valign="top" width="180px" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img valign="top;" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2037693665/Qantas+Icons_user-approved-icon.png" style="margin: 0px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 60px;"></td></tr><tr><td valign="center" width="180px;" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 15px; height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr valign="top;" height="80px;"><td width="180px;" height="80px;" vali