">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246); margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin: 0px 40px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">± Examples are a guide only. Points required accurate as at 8 November 2021 and subject to change. Taxes, fees and carrier charges are payable in addition to the Qantas Points required.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">~ Classic Flight Rewards are subject to capacity controls, availability is limited, and some flights may not have any Classic Flight Rewards available. The Qantas Points required will be displayed during the booking process on qantas.com or Qantas Direct (fees may apply). Qantas Points and Status Credits may not be earned on Classic Flight Rewards.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">^^ Points Plus Pay allows you to choose the number of points you redeem above a specified minimum level and pay for the remainder with an accepted payment card (including VISA, MasterCard or American Express). Points Plus Pay Flights are available on any flight with a Qantas (QF) or Jetstar (JQ) flight number or selected partner airlines when travelling on a Qantas fare and booking on&nbsp;<a href="http://loyalty.qantas.com/re?l=D0I1dmq26yIduo62ghI1zITk4vt8ds2&amp;s=CMMBGALFGJBEAAPK" target="_blank" title="qantas.com" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">qantas.com</a>&nbsp;for yourself or any eligible family member. As long as there is a seat available for sale, you can book a Points Plus Pay - Flight. The points required for a Points Plus Pay - Flight includes taxes, fees and carrier charges (except any local airport fees or charges collected at the time of check-in) are subject to change and are quoted at the time of booking. Qantas Points and Status Credits may not be earned on some fare types or on&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>world® alliance or airline partner flights. See the&nbsp;<a href="http://loyalty.qantas.com/re?l=D0I1dmq26yIduo62ghI20ITk4vt8ds2&amp;s=CMMBGALFGJBEAAPK" target="_blank" title="Airline Earning Tables" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earning Tables</a>&nbsp;for eligible flights and earning classes. See more information and full&nbsp;<a href="http://loyalty.qantas.com/re?l=D0I1dmq26yIduo62ghI21ITk4vt8ds2&amp;s=CMMBGALFGJBEAAPK" target="_blank" title="Terms and Conditions" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">* To participate in this offer, Qantas Business Rewards Members must (a) register their ABN and (b) book an eligible Classic Flight Reward or Points Plus Pay - Flight from their Qantas Business Rewards account between 9 and 22&nbsp;November 2021. Only one lot of bonus points will be awarded on the first eligible flight booked. An eligible flight means a domestic or international flight which has a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia, has a ticket number commencing with '081', and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards. Bonus Qantas Points may take up to 6 weeks to be credited to your Qantas Business Rewards account up to a maximum of 5,000 bonus points per Qantas Business Rewards account. A business that has a Corporate Airfares or rebate agreement with Qantas; or is a travel agent, travel wholesaler, travel consolidator or other seller or re-seller of air travel, is not eligible for this offer. This offer cannot be used in conjunction with any other bonus offer by Qantas. In order to directly redeem Qantas Points from a Qantas Business Rewards account, the business account must have a balance of at least 3,000 Qantas Points.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">** Classic Flight Rewards are subject to capacity controls, availability is limited, and some flights may not have any Classic Flight Rewards available. The Qantas Points required will be displayed during the booking process on&nbsp;<a href="http://qantas.com/" target="_blank" title="qantas.com" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">qantas.com</a>&nbsp;or Qantas Direct (fees may apply). Qantas Points and Status Credits may not be earned on Classic Flight Rewards. The 30% discount will be automatically applied to the Qantas Points required for Eligible Flights booked between 00:01am (AEDT) 8 November 2021 and 11.59pm (AEST) 14 November 2021 for travel on Qantas Airways from 1 December 2021 until 27 October 2022, and for travel on Jetstar from 1 December 2021 until 31 August 2022. To receive the 30% discount, all flights in your Trip must be eligible Classic Flight Rewards booked in the same cabin. If you make any changes to the date and time of your Classic Flight Rewards booking, in order to be eligible to retain the 30% discount, any flight in your updated booking must be within the specified travel dates of this promotion. Eligible Classic Flight Rewards are (1) Qantas operated Australian domestic flights with a 'QF' flight number travelling on an Economy or Business Classic Flight Reward (2) Qantas operated flights with a 'QF' flight number within Australia (including Norfolk Island), travelling on an Economy or Business Classic Flight Reward (3) Jetstar operated Australian domestic flights with a 'JQ' flight number, travelling on an Economy Classic Flight Reward (4) Jetstar operated flights with a 'JQ' flight number within Australia (including Norfolk Island), travelling on an Economy Classic Flight Reward. If a Trip includes a Transfer (domestic - same day) on other partner airlines, that Trip is not eligible for this offer. If your Trip includes multiple flight segments, the 30% discount will only be applied when your whole Trip is in the same cabin. For example, a Trip from Canberra to Cairns via Sydney will be eligible for the discount if all flight segments are Economy Classic Flight Rewards or if all flight segments are Business Classic Flight Rewards. If your Trip includes multiple cabins, e.g. Canberra to Sydney in Economy and Sydney to Cairns in Business, the discount will not apply to your booking. The discount applies to the Qantas Points amount required only and does not apply to the taxes, fees and carrier charges payable to Qantas (excluding any amounts payable to third parties at the airport) which are payable in addition to the Qantas Points required, accurate as at 08 November 2021 and subject to change. Taxes, fees and carrier charges are per adult in AUD unless otherwise stated rounded up to the nearest dollar and, based on payment at&nbsp;<a href="http://qantas.com/" target="_blank" title="qantas.com" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">qantas.com</a>&nbsp;by POLi. This offer is only available for bookings made on the Qantas website or via Qantas Contact Centres (fees may apply).</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">+ Reports provided are for insights only and are provided to assist your business with reconciling expenditure made via Qantas. Reports reflect purchases made via qantas.com that have had your ABN added. Due to differing levels of user access, reports may not reflect all transactions made with your ABN. Qantas Points redeemed reflects points utilised directly from your Qantas Business Rewards account. Points redeemed via a Frequent Flyer account are not reflected in this report.</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
